      "text": "Cloud Run -> ECS Fargate / App Runner\nCloud SQL -> RDS / Aurora\nMemorystore -> ElastiCache / MemoryDB\nCloud Storage -> S3\nLogging/Monitoring -> CloudWatch + OTel",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
